<span id="A3.F6" class="ltx_figure ltx_align_center">
<span class="ltx_caption" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A3.F6.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 6</span>: </span><span id="A3.F6.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">VWA-adv embedded image.</span></span>
